n><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"基础用法\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"demo-column\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"维简设备采购计划\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          extra</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">              编辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          本次采购数量按年度维简计划填写，提交后进入审批流。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"无操作区的卡片\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>表头只剩标题，右侧不会留下空盒子。&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>既不传标题也不传操作区时，表头整块不渲染，正文直接贴着卡片内边距。&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
